add(R, `다음 대화의 밑줄 친 ⓐ~ⓔ 중, 어법상 어색한 것은?\n\nW: There are so many pieces of information we call "facts" that are ⓐ<u>completely</u> wrong.\nM: Why do you say so?\nW: I read a book, and there ⓑ<u>was</u> a lot of examples of ⓒ<u>these</u> facts that are wrong.\nM: Like what?\nW: Well, most people ⓓ<u>think</u> goldfish are not smart. But goldfish are actually smart.\nM: Really? Can you tell me more about that?\nW: They can ⓔ<u>recognize</u> their owners.\nM: Oh, I didn't know that.`, '2', CIRCLE);
