add(R, `다음 글을 읽고, 내용을 바르게 이해한 사람은?\n\n${FN1}`, '1', ['윤기: 가짜 뉴스는 사람들을 잘못 이끌 수도 있다.', '정국: 모든 뉴스에서는 풍족한 정보를 얻을 수 있어.', '지민: 역사를 통틀어 모든 뉴스는 진실만을 보도해 왔어.', '태형: 매일 재미있는 뉴스를 볼 수만 있다면 그것이 가짜라고 해도 상관없어.', '석진: 뉴스가 가짜일 수도 있다니! 그럼 난 앞으로 평생 뉴스를 안 보겠어.']);
const AD120 = `Last night, an angry group of rhinoceroses broke down the walls of the cage at the zoo and ⓐ<u>escaped</u>. They also broke down the walls of the other wild animals' cages. These animals ran down the streets and ⓑ<u>injured</u> hundreds of people. Twelve of the animals are still on the loose. Citizens should stay indoors until further notice.\n\n*Not a single act or incident ⓒ<u>described</u> above (A)______________.\nAt that time, those who read the article carefully laughed out loud. Those who didn't read it to the end got really worried. Not knowing the news was false, many people ⓓ<u>panicked</u>. Some tried to escape the city while others went into the parks with guns to hunt the animals. So why did The Herald make up such news? Later, they ⓔ<u>confessed</u> that they (B)__________ so that they could draw the readers' attention to the unsafe conditions at the zoo.`;
