add(R, `다음 자전거 이용 안전에 대한 표를 보고 2개의 문장을 <조건>에 알맞게 완성하시오.\n\n<조건>\n• (A)와 (B)에서 의미가 통하는 표현을 각각 골라 연결하여 한 문장으로 쓸 것\n• 'so that ~ can'을 반드시 이용할 것${FULL}\n\n| (A) | (B) |\n|---|---|\n| • Wear a helmet<br>• Never use your phone<br>• Wear a bright-colored clothes | • Drivers watch their car<br>• People see you at night<br>• You protect your head |\n\n(1) ______________________________\n(2) ______________________________`, 'Wear a helmet so that you can protect your head. / Wear a bright-colored clothes so that people can see you at night.', null, { subParts: [{ label: '(1)', answer: 'Wear a helmet so that you can protect your head.', acceptedAnswers: ['Wear a bright-colored clothes so that people can see you at night.'] }, { label: '(2)', answer: 'Wear a bright-colored clothes so that people can see you at night.', acceptedAnswers: ['Wear a helmet so that you can protect your head.'] }] });
